Generic single-database alembic migrations for aiBazi backend.

Usage:
  # generate a migration after editing models
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

  # apply migrations
  alembic upgrade head

  # roll back one
  alembic downgrade -1

DATABASE_URL is read from .env via app.core.config — no need to set
sqlalchemy.url in alembic.ini.
